# Trained output stays out of the repo in bulk - a DQN resume checkpoint carries its replay
# buffer and runs to ~72 MB. The small artefacts below are force-added (`git add -f`) and so
# ARE tracked despite these rules, which is what lets the team read the results and load the
# trained policies without re-running anything:
#   notebooks/results/partc/**              tables, CSVs and figures behind the report
#   notebooks/runs/partc/**/best_model.*    trained weights
#   notebooks/runs/partc/**/validation.csv  learning curves
#   notebooks/runs/partc/manifest.json      which runs finished, and their best scores
runs/
results/

# Local AI tooling (oh-my-agent, agent skills); recreate with `oma install`
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.grok/
.qwen/
.zcode/
.serena/
.mcp.json
.github/prompts/
.github/skills/
.github/mcp.json
